    "promptText": "Use case: stylized-concept.\nAsset type: FOUR separate NEW reusable casual-game product-object icon illustrations on one genuinely transparent square sprite sheet.\nPrimary request: draw exactly four independent object illustrations, polished friendly soft3D cartoon style with clear bevels, bright gold/orange/red and a muted silver-grey medal. NEW art from the described concepts, not screenshot crops.\nComposition: square1024x1024 master. Exactly TWO columns and TWO rows, each512x512 cell. Subject order is TOP LEFT A, TOP RIGHT B, BOTTOM LEFT C, BOTTOM RIGHT D. Each subject stays in its own cell and is centered, with very generous genuinely transparent gutters and at least60px empty transparent separation from adjacent objects/canvas borders. Do not connect cells or draw grid lines. These will be cropped into four separate reusable icons.\nA TOP LEFT: one upright perfectly CIRCULAR GOLD MEDALLION/disc, front face toward camera, thick softly bevelled gold rim and a flat blank golden-yellow center. Bright but warm polished metal with gentle highlights. Its external silhouette remains round, no ribbon or stand. The center is completely BLANK: no emblem, no M, no letters, no icon, no star, no face.\nB TOP RIGHT: one upright perfectly CIRCULAR GREY/SILVER MEDALLION/disc, the SAME basic shape and framing as A, front face toward camera, thick softly bevelled muted silver-grey rim and a flat blank neutral medium-grey center. Soft satin metal highlights, not bright white chrome; grey color resembling an ordinary muted silver collectible. Its external silhouette remains round, no ribbon or stand. Center completely BLANK: no emblem, no M, no letters, no icon, no star, no face. Do not add lock or ownership symbols, do not blur or disable the artwork.\nC BOTTOM LEFT: ONE orange/golden-yellow wrapped GIFT BOX with a very large shiny vivid RED RIBBON and two big looped bow ears on top. A friendly chunky rounded cubic present, slight three-quarter view, clean readable shape. Gift box ALONE, no cash, no dice, no coins, no packs or other objects beside it.\nD BOTTOM RIGHT: TWO overlapping upright ORANGE FOIL CARD PACKS as one compact group. One larger pack in front and one slightly angled pack behind it, visible scalloped/crimped sealed edges at top and bottom, smooth blank orange foil fronts and soft bevelled highlights. Both packs are COMPLETELY BLANK, no logo, no M, no letters, no numbers, no stars, no reward symbols, no animal/faces, no printed art. Packs ALONE, no cash, no coins, no dice, no gift or other objects beside them.\nStyle/medium: cohesive polished soft3D cartoon casual mobile board-game art, smooth sculpted shapes, clear readable silhouettes, gentle internal shading. Only physical object form and material; no surrounding UI styling.\nBackground: genuine alpha transparency outside the object silhouettes and in all gaps and margins. No colored background, no painted checkerboard, no floor or ground plane, no cast/drop shadow outside silhouettes.\nText: NONE.\nHard constraints: exactly FOUR subjects in correct2x2order. No UI or screenshot, no panel, no frame around the objects, no button, no label, no banner, no price, no quantity, no timer, no badges, no reward numbers, no external circles behind objects, no logo/emblem/lettering anywhere, no M marks, no watermark, no cash, no dice, no extra coins beside gifts/packs, no shelf or display case architecture. The medal rim belongs only to the physical round metal disc, not an added UI border. Keep medals separate from gifts/packs, never assemble a shelf bundle."
  },
